@startuml
actor Student
participant "School LMS" as LMS

Student -> LMS: Submit work for an assignment
activate LMS
LMS -> LMS: Check course access and assignment availability

alt Student is not authorized or assignment is unavailable
  LMS --> Student: Show reason submission cannot proceed
else Student is authorized and assignment is available
  LMS -> LMS: Validate and record submission
  alt Submission is recorded
    LMS --> Student: Confirm successful submission
  else Submission cannot be recorded
    LMS --> Student: Report failure; do not show success
  end
end

deactivate LMS
@enduml
